    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__Subscription__c records whose current quantity drifts from the originating quote line quantity without an amendment trail.
Why it matters: Subscription quantities silently changed mid-term — the customer is paying for a different amount than the contract says. Usually data-load or integration drift.
Suppress a finding: when a documented manual adjustment exists.
Disable the detector: only if quantity drift is normal in your operations. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
